PocketSword

PocketSword is a GPL'd Bible study app for iOS, originally built on the CrossWire
SWORD C++ API. This repo is a fork of https://bitbucket.org/niccarter/pocketsword,
rewritten in Swift/SwiftUI for current iPhones and iPads. It ships the KJV, Matthew
Henry's Concise Commentary and three lexicons, baked into a bundled SQLite store.

Open PocketSword.xcodeproj in Xcode (beta, iOS 27 SDK) and build the PocketSword
scheme. There are no package-manager steps. See CLAUDE.md for build, test and
architecture notes.
